sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Offline client
  participant O as Durable outbox
  participant A as RepairFlow API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  C->>O: Commit local operation + stable operationId
  O->>A: Replay mutation with expected version
  A->>D: Check idempotency journal and entity version
  alt already applied
    D-->>A: Previous result
    A-->>O: Idempotent replay result
  else conflict
    D-->>A: Current version + changed fields
    A-->>O: Explicit conflict
  else accepted
    A->>D: Atomic mutation + sync change
    A-->>O: Result + cursor
  end
  O->>A: Delta pull after cursor
  A-->>C: Changes + tombstones + next cursor
